    "description": "Dive Group Inc. provides human resources and regional revitalization business in Japan. The company provides a recruitment service in resort jobs, and works with resort hotels under ResortBaito Dive; and temporary staffing and employment placement services to tourist facilities such as inns, restaurants, theme parks, leisure facilities, and ski resorts. The company also operates regional revitalization and tourism businesses, including the management of glamping facilities under the The Lantown brand; and create local and stay-type small hotels under the Craft Hotel brand. In addition, it operates Glampicks, a web media platform focused on glamping facilities and outdoor hotels; and develops solutions that enable direct to consumer business, such as accommodation reservation and website management systems. Further, the company provides introduction and support services for foreigners to accommodations facilities; and staff management system for the tourism industry Dive Group Inc. was formerly known as Dive Inc. and changed its name to Dive Group Inc. in July 2026. The company was incorporated in 2002 and is headquartered in Shinjuku, Japan."
